Deduct `hedgingFees` from `usedFunds` to offset the `hedgingFees` added in `_hedge()`.

For example, in openLong change

```solidity
usedFunds -= int256(tradeCost); 
```

to

```solidity
usedFunds -= int256(tradeCost) - int256(hedgingFees);
