```
This renders sqth buying orders block void, i.e. it will be always _p.orders[0].quantity>=remainingToSell:
Netting.sol#L504-L524
```solidity
uint256 sqthToSell = _debtToMint(_p.totalDeposit);
// step 1 get all the eth in
