) -> Result<WorkerFee> {
    let fee = quote_executor(
        executor_config,
        dst_eid,
        sender,
        calldata_size,
        options,
        accounts
    );
--------------
```
Therefore, a malicious actor can prevent execution through the ULN as long as
they keep the deny list updated

The function commit in DistributedRewardDistribution.sol is used to save a reward commit. However this function does not check if the toBlock is larger than the fromBlock. Thus distributors can set toBlock to 0 even.

```solidity
require(
