**Proof of Concept:**
```solidity
`BondNFT` has a mechanism to update the time `tigAsset` rewards are distributed. It uses a map that points to the last timestamp rewards were distributed for `epoch[tigAsset]`.

`distribute` function in `BondNFT`:

