See comment on this vulnerability in the initial primary issue [#1641](https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-02-ai-arena-findings/issues/1641#issuecomment-199163424).

**Proof of Concept:**
```solidity
If you lose in a game, `_addResultPoints` is called, and the staked tokens move to the StakeAtRisk.

```solidity
