Only one of the two incoming tokens are used to determine the amount of pool tokens minted (amountLP) on join
```solidity
amountLP = Math.min(
    _token0InU112.mul(supplyLP).divDown(_token0ReserveU112),
    _token1InU112.mul(supplyLP).divDown(_token1ReserveU112)
