IPlatformLogic(platformLogic).applyPlatformFeeCloseErc20Gmx() is called to take the platform fee and it calls _applyPlatformFeeCloseErc20Gmx() to implement here. While this function updates the token amounts for the referrer withdrawal between lines #530-#534 by calling the addTokenFeesForWithdrawal() function:
